Third-party notices
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

KOReader
  This plugin runs inside KOReader (https://github.com/koreader/koreader), which
  is licensed under the GNU AGPL v3. No KOReader code is included in this
  repository; the plugin only uses KOReader's public Lua modules at run time.

Nerd Fonts Symbols
  The toolbar draws its Wi-Fi icon with glyphs from the Nerd Fonts
  symbols font that ships with KOReader (https://www.nerdfonts.com, MIT / OFL).
  Only code points are referenced; no font files are included.

KOReader icons
  The toolbar buttons use icons that ship with KOReader (resources/icons). They
  are referenced by name; no icon files are included.

